---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../lib/site-config';
---
<BaseLayout title={`Privacy — ${siteConfig.siteName}`} description={`What ${siteConfig.siteName} does and doesn't collect.`}>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated October 2026.</em></p>

    <p>{siteConfig.siteName} is a simple, static website. There are no user accounts
    or logins.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>Our hosting provider, Cloudflare, keeps standard server logs (like IP
    address and browser type) for security and performance, in line with
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare's
    own privacy policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Comments and polls</h2>
    <p>If you leave a Worker Pulse comment or vote in a shift poll, we don't
    store your raw IP address. It's converted with a one-way hash (combined
    with a private value we hold, so the hash can't be reversed back into
    your real IP) and kept only to prevent the same visitor from submitting
    repeated comments or votes in a short window. That hash isn't linked to
    anything else about you, and isn't shared with anyone.</p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>This site may show advertising served by Google AdSense, gated behind
    the cookie banner — see the <a href="/cookies/">cookies page</a> for
    exactly what that involves and how to opt out of personalized ads.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>This site may use Google Analytics to understand how many people
    read it and which pages they visit. Like the advertising above, it's
    gated behind the same cookie banner — see the <a href="/cookies/">cookies
    page</a> for details.</p>

    <h2>If you email us</h2>
    <p>We use your email address only to respond to you. We don't add it to a
    mailing list or share it with anyone else.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If what we collect changes beyond what's described here, this page
    and the <a href="/cookies/">cookies page</a> will be updated to reflect
    it.</p>

    <p>Questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.prose { max-width: 36rem; }
.prose h2 { margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.prose p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
</style>
